{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "641634f292e6a55f463bb102d98c28bab56fcefd0c7e51324e71fac047c76d29", "ja": "私がキラキラになる方法", "zh": "让我闪闪发光的方法", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d13df1bff86c743358e46ca9c35941a6e83349cd24bb0f0a6d3ad0775fef9ae2", "ja": "杏奈にインタビューの仕事がくる。低いテン\nションでは迷惑かもと不安げな杏奈に、\nプロデューサーは衣装の着用を提案する。\nハイテンションになった杏奈は、キラキラな\n自分に喜びながら仕事へと向かうのだった。", "zh": "杏奈接到了采访的工作。担心自己情绪低落可能会给别人添麻烦的杏奈，制作人提议让她穿上服装。变得兴奋起来的杏奈，为闪闪发光的自己感到开心，前往工作现场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1000_null", "source_sha256": "e4e759cb13bc2c049fbd9ba709a4f7bc500ccc949bd56c690c77578c3a28e2d1", "ja": "インストアライブイベント\n本番数日前……", "zh": "店内现场演出活动\n正式演出前几天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "5a0e8723b1d618fe43d569947b1ff8feff350ad76c8a3df6ca066d4e95108bde", "ja": "え……。\n杏奈、インタビュー受けるの……？", "zh": "诶……  \n杏奈要接受采访吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "6562c070542d862f7df5e8fd4decec34a45cb0d3ecd250aa7b3128cb190520f2", "ja": "ああ。イベントの宣伝のために、\nいろんなメディアへ露出していかないとな。", "zh": "嗯。为了宣传活动，得在各种媒体上露面才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "a0027a842c0711139729ce0826ec6e1c4dcd3898a137fa56be6f48a42c147594", "ja": "インタビュー……。\nちょっぴり、不安……です……。", "zh": "采访……有点……不安……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1004_401pro", "source_sha256": "e5185671463fc824e8bb0ecfbfc97cdcdda2c0b2b66e7e6cd897f64f1a494577", "ja": "思ったまま、素直に答えてくれて大丈夫だよ。\nもちろん俺も隣についてるし！", "zh": "只要按你所想的如实回答就行了。\n当然，我也会陪在身边的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "495c6ef060981accc224ec8e3f4eb008ebf5d6485617ff103ec8856ed12ba537", "ja": "ありがと、ございます……。\n……でも……。", "zh": "谢谢……您。\n……但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "c5cc17640af6147001ae7fcb639fb0903093b099c3e74749dfbbebea4367c159", "ja": "杏奈、しゃべるの、遅いから……\n……相手のひと、こまるかも……。", "zh": "因为杏奈说话比较慢……\n……对方可能会觉得困扰……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1007_401pro", "source_sha256": "6fdbc175b318fae1328eff88201bf0cdaba8797fa9695f7be3c1a82ff50ab551", "ja": "それは大丈夫だと思うけど……。\n心配なら、テンションをあげた状態になればいいかな？", "zh": "我觉得那个应该没关系……  \n要是担心的话，保持高涨的情绪就好了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1008_401pro", "source_sha256": "84887bce69ea78d2ceb1662890ad2a07f2985871b43f1b996b766748790cae34", "ja": "よし、じゃあゲームでもするか！\n……あ。ゲームしてる時も、杏奈は静かだっけ？", "zh": "好，那就来玩个游戏吧！\n……啊。杏奈在玩游戏的时候，好像也是安安静静的来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "d2695cdba6f9444413692cc667b3d5037c1985a51eed199de9ae6299fe4964e1", "ja": "ん……ゲームのテキストチャットだと、元気……\nでも、杏奈は、オフのまま……です。", "zh": "嗯……在游戏的文字聊天里，我会很有精神……\n但是，杏奈还是处于离线状态……哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1010_401pro", "source_sha256": "8a408a952c98c16fbfd2c044b8a16ae190ae799dac27d11074d3bbaa4c83a68b", "ja": "そ、そうだよな……ええと、他にアイディアは……。\n撮影もあるから、あんまり時間もないし……。", "zh": "是、是啊……呃，还有没有别的主意……  \n还要拍摄，所以时间也不太多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "ab77d0c099c64ac713c8267ac8cf9292de35051d526e7cb347b963bdcda052b0", "ja": "撮影……？", "zh": "拍摄……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1012_401pro", "source_sha256": "3331db24857bda6a3914816c21d2635dda7e1c66eb3b3ccee51ddc3514ac5b12", "ja": "インタビューのあと、新しい衣装で撮影があるんだ。\nさっき青羽さんが仕上げてくれて……、あ。", "zh": "采访结束后，还要穿新服装拍摄呢。\n刚才青羽小姐帮我做好了……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1013_401pro", "source_sha256": "cf8cc05cb26e16ba8e7775ca85fc24a9bb9c586d9146c310fd23ccb0517b9020", "ja": "それだ！！", "zh": "就是那个！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "113a27c05780feb3184dc2e9ebdcce736a6b801d52ac47954809dc61abf01873", "ja": "それ……！", "zh": "就是那个……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "f50448aad0cfa2afbfe49057a92074214942068146386b77280374ad577ebc30", "ja": "イッエーイ！！\n杏奈、テンションMAXです！！！！", "zh": "耶——！！\n杏奈现在情绪MAX！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "c15dc04c9fc076a018d2183249aafac449d5b771e176b51eb8b6b3a8c7d4a6e9", "ja": "プロデューサーさん！　どうですか？\n今の杏奈、キラキラになれてますか？", "zh": "制作人！怎么样？\n现在的杏奈，有没有变得闪闪发光？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "ff4a182a4740a41f560998f0cd0768d34aa39989ddbd1453eceeda274e93b69e", "ja": "もちろん！\nステージの上と同じくらい、輝いてるぞ！", "zh": "当然！\n和在舞台上时一样闪闪发光哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "95ff6edd7f19f2c6f984a4c4c2aca0be51d3cab0f5360df640f0a856423571cf", "ja": "えへへ……♪　杏奈、アイドルの衣装を着せてもらう\nたびに、少しずつキラキラできてる気がするの。", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪杏奈每次穿上偶像服装，都觉得自己好像一点一点变得闪闪发光了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "bd0909c1536a6cb93a4eca3ef6a3eb861932767fb9f1f1e70dd3796b44af4a97", "ja": "MILLIONSTARSの衣装も、Team1stの衣装も、\nこれからの衣装も！　いっぱい、いろんな衣装を着て！", "zh": "MILLIONSTARS的服装也好，Team1st的服装也好，\n还有今后的服装也是！杏奈想穿上好多好多各种各样的服装！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "9784ce4ce13b6b7c6710793ced81d0a414058e9dde3af216db8b367cc6d2be38", "ja": "誰にも負けないくらいキラキラになりたい！\nだって杏奈たちはTeam1st！　一番の星だもん！！", "zh": "想要比任何人都闪耀！因为我们是Team1st！是最亮的星啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "781997e711a2cfaa0b6eb8fedff4678037cf903e8e7edd04789793b96eb8d0af", "ja": "……ああ、その意気だ！\nよし、このままインタビュー受けようか！", "zh": "……嗯，就是要有这样的气势！\n好，那就这样去接受采访吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_03_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "f2ab5f14cf7c5760e22b907871e1bb56179192f16f4cd39a76d977f11f71fd96", "ja": "了解です！　プロデューサーさん見ててね！\n杏奈、ビビッとどこまでも！　……いってきまーす！！", "zh": "了解！制作人看好了哦！\n杏奈会一直活力满满地冲下去！……我出发啦——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
